WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:10.002
&gt;&gt;&gt; Tonight lethal support as

00:00:10.069 --> 00:00:12.304
U.S. Officials warn beijing may

00:00:12.438 --> 00:00:13.439
soon supply weapons to Russia to

00:00:13.572 --> 00:00:16.008
use in Ukraine, but already

00:00:16.008 --> 00:00:17.343
there are signs that China is

00:00:17.476 --> 00:00:18.477
providing crucial help to prop

00:00:18.611 --> 00:00:20.012
up Putin's forces.

00:00:20.012 --> 00:00:21.013
Will Ripley has more in this

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:24.917
"Outfront" investigation.

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:26.852
[ Sirens ]

00:00:26.986 --> 00:00:28.020
&gt;&gt; Reporter: What will it take

00:00:28.053 --> 00:00:30.022
to stop the suffering, the

00:00:30.089 --> 00:00:32.024
senseless slaughter of Russia's

00:00:32.091 --> 00:00:33.592
unprovoked war on Ukraine?

00:00:34.026 --> 00:00:35.694
One year in, president Vladimir

00:00:36.028 --> 00:00:37.463
Putin has a problem, ammo is

00:00:37.596 --> 00:00:38.264
running low.

00:00:38.397 --> 00:00:40.032
The U.S. Government says Russia

00:00:40.132 --> 00:00:42.434
will run out of serviceable

00:00:42.568 --> 00:00:44.036
ammunition this year.

00:00:44.036 --> 00:00:46.438
Moscow denies they have a fading

00:00:46.572 --> 00:00:48.507
arsenal, forcing their military

00:00:48.641 --> 00:00:50.042
to conserve unless they get

00:00:50.075 --> 00:00:50.242
help.

00:00:50.376 --> 00:00:52.044
Help the U.S. And nato say could

00:00:52.077 --> 00:00:53.646
come from China.

00:00:54.046 --> 00:00:56.048
&gt;&gt; To date we have seen Chinese

00:00:56.048 --> 00:00:56.815
companies and, of course, in

00:00:56.949 --> 00:00:58.450
China there's no distinction

00:00:58.584 --> 00:00:59.618
between private companies and

00:01:00.052 --> 00:01:02.454
the state, we have seen them

00:01:02.588 --> 00:01:04.156
provide nonlethal support to

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:05.591
Russia for use in Ukraine.

00:01:05.724 --> 00:01:08.060
The concern that we have now is

00:01:08.093 --> 00:01:09.328
based on information we have

00:01:09.461 --> 00:01:10.429
that they're considering

00:01:10.563 --> 00:01:11.664
providing lethal support.

00:01:12.064 --> 00:01:12.831
&gt;&gt; Reporter: China denies it

00:01:12.965 --> 00:01:15.501
calling the claims unfounded, a

00:01:15.634 --> 00:01:17.002
ploy, a smear.

00:01:17.136 --> 00:01:18.938
Beijing and Moscow declared a no

00:01:19.071 --> 00:01:20.973
limits partnership last year.

00:01:21.106 --> 00:01:22.875
CNN obtained a new report

00:01:23.008 --> 00:01:24.476
showing Moscow may already be

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:26.445
getting a boost on the

00:01:26.579 --> 00:01:28.080
battlefield from beijing.

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:29.515
Troves of trade data, collected

00:01:29.648 --> 00:01:31.750
and supplied by the center for

00:01:32.084 --> 00:01:34.420
advanced studies, a D.C. Think

00:01:34.553 --> 00:01:36.555
tank that shows China sending

00:01:36.689 --> 00:01:38.090
Russian defense companies

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:38.624
sophisticated parts.

00:01:38.757 --> 00:01:40.225
&gt;&gt; We see the nature of these

00:01:40.359 --> 00:01:44.263
parts being labeled for use in

00:01:44.396 --> 00:01:44.763
military systems.

00:01:44.897 --> 00:01:46.398
&gt;&gt; Reporter: CNN did not verify

00:01:46.532 --> 00:01:48.233
the data showing a steady supply

00:01:48.367 --> 00:01:50.502
of parts, dramatically

00:01:50.636 --> 00:01:52.104
increasing after the invasion.

00:01:52.104 --> 00:01:57.743
They could be helping Russia

00:01:58.110 --> 00:01:58.243
resupply.

00:01:58.243 --> 00:02:00.546
Roors for attack helicopter,

00:02:00.679 --> 00:02:03.015
radar antenna parts for

00:02:03.148 --> 00:02:03.716
anti-aircraft missile systems

00:02:04.116 --> 00:02:05.784
sent to a Russian defense

00:02:06.118 --> 00:02:07.319
company labeled for military

00:02:07.453 --> 00:02:09.388
use, the think tank says.

00:02:09.521 --> 00:02:11.023
Their data shows military

00:02:11.156 --> 00:02:12.891
assistance from several Chinese

00:02:13.025 --> 00:02:15.327
companies, even before the war,

00:02:15.461 --> 00:02:18.163
dual use aircraft, radar and lab

00:02:18.297 --> 00:02:18.530
equipment.

00:02:18.664 --> 00:02:22.134
Flowing into Russia 268 times.

00:02:22.134 --> 00:02:26.138
Shipped by polygroup or

00:02:26.205 --> 00:02:27.506
polytechnologies, a state-backed

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:28.574
Chinese arms manufacturer.

00:02:28.707 --> 00:02:30.442
CNN contacted polygroup for

00:02:30.576 --> 00:02:32.144
comment along with several other

00:02:32.144 --> 00:02:33.512
Chinese companies shown in the

00:02:33.646 --> 00:02:33.812
data.

00:02:34.146 --> 00:02:35.681
So far no response.

00:02:35.814 --> 00:02:39.785
&gt;&gt; Any trade between a

00:02:40.152 --> 00:02:40.886
sanctioned Chinese state owned

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:43.088
defense company and a Russian

00:02:43.222 --> 00:02:45.057
sanctioned defense company

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:47.226
during wartime, any trade really

00:02:47.359 --> 00:02:50.162
at all is indicative of a

00:02:50.162 --> 00:02:51.563
growing partnership that

00:02:51.697 --> 00:02:52.398
potentially be of concern.

00:02:52.531 --> 00:02:54.433
&gt;&gt; Reporter: The data implies

00:02:54.566 --> 00:02:56.635
deepening cooperation, the U.S.

00:02:56.769 --> 00:02:57.636
Suspects China of creeping

00:02:57.770 --> 00:03:00.172
closer and closer to fully

00:03:00.172 --> 00:03:01.840
supporting Russia's war.

00:03:02.174 --> 00:03:04.176
The consequences for Ukraine

00:03:04.176 --> 00:03:05.310
could be catastrophic.

00:03:05.444 --> 00:03:08.447
&gt;&gt; Sudden inflow of Chinese

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:11.216
weapons into the Russians could

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:13.318
fundamentally shift the dynamics

00:03:13.452 --> 00:03:14.319
in Moscow's favor.

00:03:14.453 --> 00:03:15.254
&gt;&gt; Reporter: When asked about

00:03:15.387 --> 00:03:18.190
allegations of backing Moscow,

00:03:18.190 --> 00:03:19.224
beijing blames Washington.

00:03:19.358 --> 00:03:21.326
[ Speaking non-english ]

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:23.429
Saying, it's the U.S., not China

00:03:23.562 --> 00:03:25.064
providing a steady stream of

00:03:25.197 --> 00:03:26.265
weapons on the battlefield.

00:03:26.398 --> 00:03:28.934
Off the battlefield, trade data

00:03:29.068 --> 00:03:32.971
reveals Russia may be bypassing

00:03:33.105 --> 00:03:33.672
western sanctions buying

00:03:33.806 --> 00:03:34.940
blacklisted advanced technology

00:03:35.074 --> 00:03:35.541
from beijing.

00:03:35.674 --> 00:03:37.810
The kind of tech Putin's army

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:39.812
needs to power high-tech weapons

00:03:40.212 --> 00:03:41.747
and communication systems.

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:44.249
Why would China risk so much for

00:03:44.383 --> 00:03:44.583
Russia?

00:03:44.717 --> 00:03:46.218
&gt;&gt; It's in their interest to

00:03:46.318 --> 00:03:48.754
have a Russian victory and to

00:03:48.887 --> 00:03:51.890
have the United States and its

00:03:52.224 --> 00:03:54.359
lies humiliated.

00:03:54.493 --> 00:03:55.861
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Meeting in Moscow

00:03:56.228 --> 00:03:57.529
Wednesday just two days after

00:03:57.663 --> 00:03:59.231
president Biden's surprise trip

00:03:59.364 --> 00:04:01.867
to Kyiv, democracy and

00:04:02.234 --> 00:04:03.402
autocracy, a fight for the

00:04:03.535 --> 00:04:06.438
future of Ukraine and perhaps

00:04:06.572 --> 00:04:07.206
the free world.

00:04:07.339 --> 00:04:08.507
The Chinese foreign minister

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:09.708
made that high-profile visit to

00:04:09.842 --> 00:04:11.543
Moscow just before the one-year

00:04:11.677 --> 00:04:12.911
anniversary of Russia's invasion

00:04:13.045 --> 00:04:14.379
of Ukraine and that meeting is

00:04:14.513 --> 00:04:16.248
widely believed to be a

00:04:16.248 --> 00:04:17.916
precursor for a meeting in the

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:19.351
coming months between Chinese

00:04:19.485 --> 00:04:21.553
president XI jinping and Russian

00:04:21.687 --> 00:04:22.254
president Vladimir Putin.

00:04:22.321 --> 00:04:23.622
What exactly they'll discuss

00:04:23.756 --> 00:04:24.790
remains an open question whether

00:04:24.923 --> 00:04:27.092
it's China's widely publicized

00:04:27.226 --> 00:04:28.293
peace plan or something else.

00:04:28.427 --> 00:04:30.662
But what is clear is that this

00:04:30.796 --> 00:04:32.264
cooperation, this tie between

00:04:32.264 --> 00:04:34.299
Russia and China remains rock

00:04:34.433 --> 00:04:34.600
solid.

00:04:34.733 --> 00:04:36.568
The world's two largest

00:04:36.702 --> 00:04:37.369
authoritarian powers both

00:04:37.503 --> 00:04:38.437
nuclear armed.

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:38.971
Kate.

00:04:39.104 --> 00:04:40.706
&gt;&gt; Will, thank you so much.

00:04:40.839 --> 00:04:43.008
&gt;&gt;&gt; And CNN has reached out to

00:04:43.142 --> 00:04:44.276
Russia for comment on this

00:04:44.376 --> 00:04:45.944
report but hasn't gotten a

00:04:46.278 --> 00:04:46.311
response.

00:04:46.445 --> 00:04:50.415
Kremlin spokesman dmitry peskov

00:04:50.549 --> 00:04:52.818
pushed back on ammunition

00:04:52.951 --> 00:04:54.286
shortages telling "The wall

00:04:54.319 --> 00:04:55.187
Street journal," Russia has

